{
  "id": "1SA.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samuele 23",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakambila Davidi ne, Bena Peleshete badi baluangana ne Bena Kila, badi biba bintu bia bishihuidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakakonka Yehowa ne, Nenye bua kushiha Bena Peleshete aba, anyi? Yehowa wakambila Davidi ne, Ya, ushihe Bena Peleshete, usungile Kila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu ba Davidi bakamuambila ne, Mona, tuetu ludi tutshina kunoko mu Yuda, nunku ludi tutamba kutshina bua kuya ku Kila bua kuluangana ne Bena Peleshete nansha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Davidi wakebesha Yehowa tshiakabidi. Yehowa wakamukudimuna dî ne, Juka, uye ku Kila, bualu bua meme nenfile Bena Peleshete mu tshianza tshiebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi ne bantu bandi bakaya ku Kila, bakaluangana ne Bena Peleshete, bakabashiha ne kushiha kukole, bakahingana ne ngombe yabo. Nunku Davidi wakasungila Bena Kila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakanyema Ebeyatâ, muana wa Ahimeleke, kudi Davidi mu Kila, yeye wakadi mulue ne efoda mu tshianza tshiandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamanyisha Shaula ne, Davidi wakaya ku Kila. Shaula wakamba ne, Nzambi wakamufila mu tshianza tshianyi; bualu bua yeye wakabuela mu musoko udi ne bibi bidi bibaka bikole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakasangisha bantu bandi ba nvita, bua kuya ku Kila bua kutshintshimika Davidi ne bantu bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakamanya ne, Shaula udi ungelela tshifulu: nunku yeye wakabikila Ebeyatâ muakuidi, wakamuambila ne, Lua kundi ne efoda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe wakamba ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, bulelela, muntu webe wakunvua lumu ne, Shaula udi ukeba mua kulua ku Kila bua kubutula musoko bualu buanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Kila nebaufile mu tshianza tshiandi, anyi? Shaula nealue bu lumu luakunvua muntu webe, anyi? Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, ndi nkusengelela ne, Umanyishe muntuʼebe. Yehowa wakamuambila ne, Yeye ulualua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Davidi wakakonka ne, Bena Kila nebaufile ne bantu banyi mu tshianza tshia Shaula, anyi? Yehowa wakamba ne, Nebanufile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Davidi ne bantu bandi bu nkama isambombo bakajuka, bakumuka mu Kila, bakaya kuakamanyabo mua kuya. Bakamanyisha Shaula ne, Davidi wakumuka mu Kila; yeye wakalekela kuyaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakashikama mu tshihela mu misoko ya ngumbu; wakashala mu mikuna mu tshihela tshia Zifa. Shaula wakamukeba ku dituku ku dituku, kadi Nzambi kakamufila mu tshianza tshiandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakamanya ne, Shaula wakalua kukeba muoyo wanyi. Davidi wakadi mushikame mu tshihela tshia Zifa mu ditu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonatana, muana wa Shaula, wakajuka, wakaya kudi Davidi hakadiye muitu, wakakolesha maboko andi mu Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuambila ne, Kutshinyi, bualu bua tshianza tshia Shaula, tatuʼanyi, katshiena tshikusangana; wewe newikale mukelenge wa Isalele, ne meme nengikale muibidi nʼebe; Shaula, tatuʼanyi, udi mumanye bualu ebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bubidi buabo bakahunga tshihungidi ku mpala kua Yehowa; Davidi wakashala muitu, Yonatana wakahingana ku nsubu kuandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Bena Zifa bakaya kudi Shaula mu Gibea, bakamuambila ne, Davidi kena musokome nʼetu mu misoko ya ngumbu idi muitu ku mukuna wa Hakila udi ku Sude kua tshihela, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku mukelenge, ulue biebe bu mudi mutshima webe musue kulua; bualu buetu nebuikale bua tuetu tumufile mu tshianza tshia mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakabambila ne, Nusankishibue kudi Yehowa, bualu bua nuenu nuakanfuila luse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi nnusengelela ne, Yai bienu, nutangile bimpe muaba mudiye musokome ne bantu bakamutangilaku; bualu bua nakunvua lumu ne, Yeye udi ne budimu bua bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku yai bienu, numukebe mu miaba yonso misokome yakadiye musokome, nulue bienu, nungambile bimpe; hashishe nenye nʼenu, ne bikaleye mu buloba nemmukebulule munkatshi mua binunu bia meku a mu Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabika, bakaya ku Zifa ku mpala kua Shaula; kadi Davidi ne bantu bandi bakadi mu tshihela tshia Maona mu Alabâ ku Sude kua tshihela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula ne bantu bandi bakayaku bua kumukeba. Bakamanyisha Davidi; nunku yeye wakaya ku dibue dinene, wakashikama mu tshihela tshia Maona. Shaula wakunyua lumu elu, nunku yeye wakamulonda mu tshihela tshia Maona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula ne bantu bandi bakayila ku luseke elu lua mukuna, ne Davidi ne bantu bandi bakayila ku luseke lualua; Davidi wakaya lubilu bua kuhanduka, bualu bua yeye wakatshina Shaula; bualu bua Shaula ne bantu bandi bakadi bela Davidi ne bantu bandi munkatshi bua kubakuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi messager wakalua kudi Shaula ne, Ulue biebe lubilu, kujanguluki, bualu bua Bena Peleshete badi bahaula buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Shaula wakalekela kulonda Davidi, wakaya kuluangana ne Bena Peleshete. Nunku wakabikila muaba au ne, Sela-hamalekota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Davidi wakumukaku, wakashikama mu musoko wa mu Ene-gedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
